host_about:
Travel for me is usually for work or family visits, but from those, my favourites are;
Amsterdam, Budapest, Transylvania, Southern California, and anywhere in the Caribbean.
When I go somewhere new, my favourite way to experience it is to have a great home base, central to the areas I'd most like to explore, and which has at least a fridge if not a complete kitchen.  I find that I learn more about a place and a culture from grocery stores (or better, markets)than from restaurants.
